Z||000000||GT Bastard||09-12-2000||04:43 PM||||You come into work and your manager give you the evil eye and says: "I need to talk to you." She leads you into a small white room with nothing but a table.  Another woman from Human Resources also steps in and they proceed to tell you that you're fired.  Not only did I forget to log-out of my phone(normally not a big deal at all), I have been insubordinate, I called in sick a couple days ago to go racing, and they discovered profanity in my email!  Oh golly, not that! Anything but that!  Then I'm immediately escorted out of the building by security.  It doesn't matter that I've given two years of almost perfect attendence, became tech of the month out of 600 techs at our call center, and 13th in the nation.  A new manager is hired.... She's an anal b*tch and thinks I'm mentally unstable, and then proceeds to fire me along with two other members of my team.  Now I'm unemployed.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Have a nice day. ||||reg||1
