Z||000022||Monkeyman||09-13-2000||09:29 PM||||Bastard (or would you rather I called you "GT"? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)--You're more than welcome to come over to the Hoosier state.  I'll give you a job.  Of course, it would be as a 3rd shift clerk in a convenience store at just over minimum wage, but there are definite advancement possibilities.  Just think,  I gave up a good paying trucking job (about $55k for the last 12 months I drove) to work 100+ hours/week at $5.50/hr.  But...In about a month I'll be the store manager.  (Working about 55 hours/week for a little more than I was before.)  They're already talking about grooming me for a District Supervisor position in a couple of years.  (I get a company car with that job--impressed yet? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)  What's my point?  You should know by now that I don't necessarily have one, but this should  have been interesting reading.  (Sorry.  I'm sick and just took a double dose of Nyquil.)||||reg||1
